cale","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"? = nil) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:@M@ZendeskSDK@objc(cs)Zendesk","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.zendesk.Zendesk\/documentation\/ZendeskSDK\/Zendesk","text":"Zendesk","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"platforms":["iOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"channelKey","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The key of your Messaging iOS channel","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"messagingFactory","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Optional parameter to include the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Messaging"},{"type":"text","text":" UIKit capability, pass an initialized "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DefaultMessagingFactory"},{"type":"text","text":" here."}]}]},{"name":"messagingSwiftUIFactory","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Optional parameter to include the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Messaging"},{"type":"text","text":" SwiftUI capability,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pass an initialized "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DefaultMessagingSwiftUIFactory"},{"type":"text","text":" here."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Optional locale override (e.g. “en-US”) to use instead of the device’s language.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"An empty string or ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" uses the device’s language. The value is trimmed and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"canonicalized before use, so ","type":"text"},{"code":"\"EN\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"\"en\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"\"En\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" are equivalent and ","type":"text"},{"code":"\"en_US\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"accepted as ","type":"text"},{"code":"\"en-US\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["    The locale is fixed for the lifetime of the returned instance. Passing a different `locale` for an","    already initialized `channelKey` has no effect - call `Zendesk.invalidate()` first, then `initialize`","    with the new locale.","","    Backend content — bot replies, settings and campaigns — follows this locale, as does the","    UIKit messaging interface (labels, buttons, error messages, VoiceOver descriptions, dates and","    plural forms). Lookup falls back from an exact match (`\"en-AU\"`) to the closest available","    translation (`\"en-GB\"`) and finally to the SDK's built-in English. Your app's own string","    overrides in `Bundle.main` continue to take precedence for the chosen locale.","","    Some things deliberately keep following the device: layout *direction*, Help Center article","    *content*, the Zendesk Voice SDK interface, and regional formatting (calendar, number separators,","    file-size units)."],"type":"codeListing","syntax":null}],"name":"locale"}]},{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This method must complete successfully before ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Zendesk.instance"},{"text":" can be called.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"After a successful call has been made, calling it again with the same "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"channelKey"},{"type":"text","text":" will succeed immediately"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"without performing a network call."}]}],"name":"Attention","type":"aside"}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.zendesk.Zendesk\/documentation\/Zen